.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt SSL_GET_RBIO 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm SSL_get_rbio ,
.Nm SSL_get_wbio
.Nd get BIO linked to an SSL object
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/ssl.h
.Ft BIO *
.Fo SSL_get_rbio
.Fa "SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Ft BIO *
.Fo SSL_get_wbio
.Fa "SSL *ssl"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn SSL_get_rbio
and
.Fn SSL_get_wbio
return pointers to the BIOs for the read or the write channel, which can
be different.
The reference count of the BIO is not incremented.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The following return values can occur:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It NULL
No BIO was connected to the SSL object
.It Any other pointer
The BIO linked to
.Fa ssl .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr SSL_set_bio 3 ,
.Xr ssl 7
,
.Xr bio 7
